>I just met Yeenoghu and thought of hiding behind a boulder fort until he 
>summoned Demo.  Can either of them break my boulders?

If they've come upon a wand of striking in their travels, sure.

However, if you're boulderforted, Yeenoghu will never summon Demogorgon
unless there's a gap in your fort. Yeenoghu is not a wizard, so cannot
summon Demogorgon via the "summon coaligned demon" chance on summon
nasties; he can only summon Demogorgon by engaging you in melee.
